    "Common File Format",
    "3.7",
    "CAD file format used for storing 3D packaging and die cutting designs; may be processed by either a compatible CAD software program or a CAM (computer-aided manufacturing) device. NOTE: Common file format files are usually saved with a.CF2 extension. Windows The Box Builder Modelmaker.",
